+# monorepo
+
+Three-package TypeScript monorepo (npm workspaces):
+
+- `@monorepo/core` — shared business logic (user management, validation, database)
+- `@monorepo/api` — Express REST API, depends on core
+- `@monorepo/worker` — background job processor, depends on core
+
+## Commands
+
+```bash
+npm install
+npm run build          # tsc -b across all packages
+npm run lint           # eslint
+npm test               # vitest (builds first via pretest)
+npm run check:circular # madge circular-import check
+```
+
+## Configuration
+
+Database settings are read from the environment. `.env` files are gitignored and
+must never be committed — create one locally with:
+
+| Variable  | Description                  | Example         |
+| --------- | ---------------------------- | --------------- |
+| `DB_HOST` | Database hostname            | `localhost`     |
+| `DB_PORT` | Database port                | `5432`          |
+| `DB_USER` | Database user                | `admin`         |
+| `DB_PASS` | Database password (secret)   | —               |
+| `DB_NAME` | Database name                | `monorepo_db`   |
+
+The test suite uses an in-memory SQLite database and needs none of these.
